粮", "description": "天顺元年四月乙未，朝廷免除浙江灾区应缴的税粮。", "start_year": 1457, "end_year": 1457, "time_original": "天顺元年四月乙未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "7610ace3-eb75-5200-b395-f28a08ddfef8"}, {"title": "方瑛平定铜鼓、藕洞一带起事", "description": "天顺元年四月丁酉，方瑛率军进攻本纪所称铜鼓、藕洞的起事苗民，平定当地起事。", "start_year": 1457, "end_year": 1457, "time_original": "天顺元年四月丁酉", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "bfd3a7b1-8ab0-5662-8c8e-0d95b7d1582f"}, {"title": "明廷复核在押人员案件", "description": "天顺元年四月丁未，明廷复核在押人员的案件。", "start_year": 1457, "end_year": 1457, "time_original": "天顺元年四月丁未", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "196425c1-8468-5c9c-8e14-4ba929790603"}, {"title": "明廷撤销团营", "description": "天顺元年四月癸丑，明廷撤销景泰年间设置的团营。", "start_year": 1457, "end_year": 1457, "time_original": "天顺元年四月癸丑", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "a485e8b2-55e0-5e4b-b251-cafe9e63b5f8"}, {"title": "孛来进攻宁夏，参将种兴阵亡", "description": "天顺元年四月乙卯，孛来所部进攻宁夏，明军参将种兴在交战中阵亡。", "start_year": 1457, "end_year": 1457, "time_original": "天顺元年四月乙卯", "dynasty": "明", "location_name": null, "location_lat": null, "location_lng": null, "location_precision": "unknown", "location_modern_name": null, "location_note": null, "status": "draft", "id": "a3c768b6-112f-5e11-84e1-cf202f3f96e8"}, {"title": "柳溥奉命防守宣府和大同边境", "description": "天顺元年五月辛未，朝廷派安远侯柳溥防守宣府、大同一带边境。", "start_year": 1457, "end_year": 1457, "time_original": "天顺元年五月辛未", "dynasty": "明", 